# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# /docs-admin/* is a LOCAL-ONLY authoring surface for the PRIVATE branded-docs
# repo (served by `astro dev` at localhost, uses Decap's local backend). It must
# never be reachable on the deployed public site — this rule 404s the whole path
# (including config.yml) in production. Redirects are always followed even when a
# matching static asset exists, so this reliably blocks the built assets too.
/docs-admin/*  /404  404
